<<<My notes
RFD's are a big deal.

On call is a mess.

Writing and reading is really important.

Comes back to an RFD later and it makes sense.

System Design (prep on this?)

Do not give feedback. They are oversubscribed.

I'm shooting for the stars so I get it if I don't get feedback :) (they are vetting people from Google and the like.)

I'll put it all out there!!!

Political, Manipulative, and dishonest and charismatic...DEADLY.

Support guy super calm (that's me) didn't swear...lol.

He's a baby eater!

These people don't like to write things down.

Unhappy in a fear driven org.

We get the others materials!

If you're not enjoying yourself find somewhere you will.

Don't want the values to weaponized.

Urgency and Rigor often come into tension.

Empathy and Candor come into tension.

* Why do you want to work here?
** Stability (not a bad reason)

What happened next on this interesting thing you did?

Am I interested in you?


